<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<rdf:RDF xmlns:ns1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xmlns:ns2="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xmlns:ns3="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://loze-ontology.org/afterTime">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" />
    <ns1:domain rdf:resource="https://loze-ontology.org/Eventuality" />
    <ns1:label>after Time</ns1:label>
    <ns1:range rdf:resource="https://loze-ontology.org/PeriodOfTime" />
    <ns2:definition>The relation that obtains between an eventuality e and a period of time t if and only if e occurs entirely after t</ns2:definition>
    <ns2:example>WWII occurred after 1900, the birth of Napoleon occurred after 1700, </ns2:example>
    <ns2:note>The relation obtains even if the eventuality does not occur immediately after the period of time: for example, WWII occurred after 1900, even though it only started in 1939</ns2:note>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://loze-ontology.org/atTime">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" />
    <ns1:domain rdf:resource="https://loze-ontology.org/Eventuality" />
    <ns1:label>at Time</ns1:label>
    <ns1:range rdf:resource="https://loze-ontology.org/PeriodOfTime" />
    <ns2:definition>The relation that obtains between an eventuality e and a period of time t if and only if e is the case or is occurring at t</ns2:definition>
    <ns2:example>WWII was happening at 1943, the French Revolution was happening at 1790, the Italian Renaissance was happening at 1513</ns2:example>
    <ns2:note>This relation doesn't necessarily relate an eventuality to the entire period of time when it occurs; for example, WWII started in 1939 and ended in 1945, but it was still in course in 1943, so it entertains the relation loze:atTime with 1943 too</ns2:note>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://loze-ontology.org/beforeTime">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" />
    <ns1:domain rdf:resource="https://loze-ontology.org/Eventuality" />
    <ns1:label>before Time</ns1:label>
    <ns1:range rdf:resource="https://loze-ontology.org/PeriodOfTime" />
    <ns2:definition>The relation that obtains between an eventuality e and a period of time t if and only if e occurs entirely before t</ns2:definition>
    <ns2:example>WWII occurred before 1960, the birth of Napoleon occurred before 1800</ns2:example>
    <ns2:note>The relation obtains even if the eventuality does not occur right before the period of time: for example, WWII occurred before 1970, even though over two decades passed between the end of WWII and 1970</ns2:note>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://loze-ontology.org/fromTime">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" />
    <ns1:domain rdf:resource="https://loze-ontology.org/Eventuality" />
    <ns1:label>from Time</ns1:label>
    <ns1:range rdf:resource="https://loze-ontology.org/PeriodOfTime" />
    <ns2:definition>The relation that obtains between an eventuality e and a period of time t if and only if e starts occurring at t</ns2:definition>
    <ns2:example>WWII occurred from 1939, the Thirty Years' War occurred from 1618, Napoleon's life occurred from 1769</ns2:example>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://loze-ontology.org/isSubPeriodOf">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" />
    <ns1:domain rdf:resource="https://loze-ontology.org/PeriodOfTime" />
    <ns1:label>is Sub-Period Of</ns1:label>
    <ns1:range rdf:resource="https://loze-ontology.org/PeriodOfTime" />
    <ns2:definition>The relation that obtains between two periods of time of which the former is a part or segment of the latter</ns2:definition>
    <ns2:example>The year 1969 is a sub-period of the XX century, the period 1740-1751 is a sub-period of the period 1740-1789, the June of 1816 is a sub-period of the year 1816</ns2:example>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://loze-ontology.org/temporal-relations">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology" />
    <ns1:label>Temporal Relations</ns1:label>
    <ns3:imports rdf:resource="https://loze-ontology.org/" />
    <ns2:definition>An extension of loze.ttl with relations for locating eventualities relative to periods of time</ns2:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://loze-ontology.org/throughoutTime">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" />
    <ns1:domain rdf:resource="https://loze-ontology.org/Eventuality" />
    <ns1:label>throughout Time</ns1:label>
    <ns1:range rdf:resource="https://loze-ontology.org/PeriodOfTime" />
    <ns2:definition>The relation that obtains between an eventuality e and a period t if and only if e occurs starting from the beginning of t until and until the end of t</ns2:definition>
    <ns2:example>WWII occurred throughout the 1939-1945 period, the Thirty Years' War occurred throghout the 1618-1648 period, Napoleon's life occurred throughout the 1769-1821 period</ns2:example>
    <ns2:note>The function of this relation is to specify the temporal location of an eventuality as a whole</ns2:note>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://loze-ontology.org/untilTime">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" />
    <ns1:domain rdf:resource="https://loze-ontology.org/Eventuality" />
    <ns1:label>until Time</ns1:label>
    <ns1:range rdf:resource="https://loze-ontology.org/PeriodOfTime" />
    <ns2:definition>The relation that obtains between an eventuality e and a period of time t if and only if e ends at t</ns2:definition>
    <ns2:example>WWII occurred until 1945, the Thirty Years' War occurred until 1648, Napoleon's life occurred until 1821</ns2:example>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://loze-ontology.org/withinTime">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" />
    <ns1:domain rdf:resource="https://loze-ontology.org/Eventuality" />
    <ns1:label>within Time</ns1:label>
    <ns1:range rdf:resource="https://loze-ontology.org/PeriodOfTime" />
    <ns2:definition>The relation that obtains betwen an eventuality e and a period of time t if and only if e occurs throughout a a sub-period of t</ns2:definition>
    <ns2:note>WWII occurred within the XX century, the Thirty Years' War occurred within the 1620-1650 period, the Italian Renaissance occurred within the second millenium</ns2:note>
  </rdf:Description>
</rdf:RDF>